#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:1 905e4e9f4f4b4b3eafcbb3011645adfe
msgid "train.py 命令行参考"
msgstr "train.py Command Line Reference"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:3 f80cd2437f9646daa8f2257658916ca7
msgid "`train.py` 是 UniKT 的核心训练入口，基于 `jsonargparse` 实现双遍反射解析，支持完整强类型分层参数配置。"
msgstr ""
"`train.py` is the core training entry point of UniKT, implementing two-"
"pass reflection parsing based on `jsonargparse` and supporting complete "
"strongly typed hierarchical parameter configurations."

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:5 cc23cfb8a0624df38c84049112301028
msgid "基本语法"
msgstr "Basic Syntax"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:7 55410892d131498cab510ac76afd903d
msgid "python train.py -m <ModelName> -d <DatasetName> [OPTIONS]\n"
msgstr "python train.py -m <ModelName> -d <DatasetName> [OPTIONS]\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:11 89cbabe5a1694ff3bd979485b359ac57
msgid "也可以通过 `--config` 引入 YAML 配置文件，并用命令行参数覆盖特定配置项："
msgstr ""
"You can also introduce a YAML configuration file via `--config`, and "
"override specific configuration items with command line arguments:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:13 c38a817893ae41a9a05cad80d121c3dc
msgid ""
"python train.py --config configs/my_experiment.yaml --model.learning_rate"
" 0.0005\n"
msgstr ""
"python train.py --config configs/my_experiment.yaml --model.learning_rate"
" 0.0005\n"

