#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:96 74d244747f5c4d0e88905faa1f654755
msgid "6. `--model.*`：模型超参数"
msgstr "6\\. `--model.*`: Model Hyperparameters"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:98 426077dda5a14ed899429982d16c852a
msgid ""
"`--model.*` 为多态命名空间，根据 `-m <ModelName>` "
"自动绑定对应模型的强类型配置类。所有模型均继承并包含以下基础训练参数："
msgstr ""
"`--model.*` is a polymorphic namespace that automatically binds the "
"strongly typed configuration class of the corresponding model based on "
"`-m <ModelName>`. All models inherit and contain the following base "
"training parameters:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md afa116de085a4202bb14c7d00d3ec362
msgid "`--model.epochs`"
msgstr "`--model.epochs`"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md 735ec8920ad644b3bc3065d26051a03e
