#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:126 de2685de08aa461fbcf20551e6aa5079
msgid "产出目录与无损复现"
msgstr "Output Directory and Lossless Reproduction"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:128 19f066bedb634ec99e73a41da8348ed2
msgid "每次训练将在 `runs/normal/` 目录下生成一个带时间戳与实验签名的独立目录："
msgstr ""
"Each training run generates a standalone directory with a timestamp and "
"experiment signature under `runs/normal/`:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:130 5a161ad2981341f4839e89f8561ffb68
msgid ""
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20260520-232131_fold0_bs128/\n"
"├── run_config.yaml         # 本次运行的全量强类型配置归档（用于无损复现与评估）\n"
"├── run_metadata.yaml       # 运行元数据（包含模型参数量、优化器类型、GPU型号等）\n"
"├── run.log                 # 完整终端运行日志\n"
"├── best_model.pth          # 验证集最优检查点权重\n"
"├── last_checkpoint.pth     # 最后一轮完整状态检查点（含优化器，用于断点续训）\n"
"├── metrics_train.csv       # 训练阶段各轮次损失与指标记录\n"
"├── metrics_val.csv         # 验证阶段各轮次指标记录\n"
"├── metrics_test.csv        # 测试集最终评估指标\n"
"└── timing.csv              # 各阶段耗时分析\n"
msgstr ""
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20260520-232131_fold0_bs128/\n"
"├── run_config.yaml         # Full strongly typed configuration archive "
"for this run (for lossless reproduction and evaluation)\n"
"├── run_metadata.yaml       # Run metadata (includes model parameter "
"count, optimizer type, GPU model, etc.)\n"
"├── run.log                 # Complete terminal execution log\n"
"├── best_model.pth          # Best checkpoint weights on validation set\n"
"├── last_checkpoint.pth     # Final epoch complete state checkpoint (with"
" optimizer, for resuming training)\n"
"├── metrics_train.csv       # Loss and metric records across training "
"epochs\n"
"├── metrics_val.csv         # Metric records across validation epochs\n"
"├── metrics_test.csv        # Final evaluation metrics on test set\n"
"└── timing.csv              # Time consumption analysis across stages\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:143 2ee0bd749fab4f3384410a0918f11ad8
msgid "使用归档配置快速复现训练"
msgstr "Quickly Reproduce Training Using Archived Configuration"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:145 e836f8284548453fb032078c8302fdf0
msgid "任何一次训练生成的 `run_config.yaml` 均可通过 `--config` 直接加载复现："
msgstr ""
"The `run_config.yaml` generated by any training run can be directly "
"loaded via `--config` to reproduce the run:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/train.md:147 816eef7c1a3a4e6096cc95957ee9b61b
msgid ""
"python train.py --config "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20260520-232131_fold0_bs128/run_config.yaml"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"python train.py --config "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20260520-232131_fold0_bs128/run_config.yaml"
"\n"

